WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,390
Miss you

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:04,430
Okay, I won’t tease you anymore.

3
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:05,950
keep telling your story

4
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:13,020
My heart beats just thinking about her face

5
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,540
Telling stories has been endless since then

6
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,900
White Snake and Fahai at Leifeng Pagoda

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,860
Lived a happy life You'er

8
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,140
Are you sure this is the end of the story?

9
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,180
That's what she told me

10
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,940
A monk lives in a tower with a snake demon

11
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:26,660
This man's idea of making up lies is quite interesting.

12
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,940
I suddenly thought of this story

13
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:31,330
Another way of telling it, look at how big a liar is

14
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,010
When did I lie to you?

15
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:37,410
White Snake and Xu Xian are a couple

16
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:38,650
Fahai is a bad guy

17
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,370
Tell me first why you said that

18
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,370
My lady told me all this

19
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,900
I thought I bumped into a colleague wearing a comb

20
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,480
It turns out it was the girl from the Tie family who heard something.

21
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,630
As expected of the Iron Lady
